From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{term|til||lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|ang|en}} {{term|til||to, until|lang=ang}}, possibly from {{etyl|non|-}} {{term|til||lang=non}}, both from {{etyl|gem-pro|en}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*tila-||goal}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|en}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*ád||near, at}}. Compare to {{etyl|ofs|en}} {{term|til|lang=ofs}}
